abstract: >
  Executable companion to Cochrane (2018) Maths Hacks: 100 Hacks mapped to
  seeded Python experiments, pytest suite (16 tests), timing/accuracy benchmarks,
  and live Yahoo-Finance verification of stochastics chapters. All claims run
  in Docker with pinned dependencies.
